<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Christ lives in me—</l><l>He’s the meaning of my human life;</l><l>Christ lives in me—</l><l>He’s the meaning of my human life.</l><l>Yes, He’s in me</l><l>My all to be;</l><l>He’s the meaning and reality of my human life.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The church is Christ—</l><l>His expression on the earth today;</l><l>The church is Christ—</l><l>His expression on the earth today.</l><l>This corporate man</l><l>Fulfills God’s plan,</l><l>That this man may have dominion over all the earth.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The local church—</l><l>It’s the new and real family life;</l><l>The local church—</l><l>It’s the new and real family life.</l><l>We have the way</l><l>To live today—</l><l>Eating, drinking Christ we’re built up as the local church.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>What shall we do?</l><l>We should go and tell the world of this.</l><l>What shall we do?</l><l>We should go and tell the world of this.</l><l>Disciple all—</l><l>This is our call.</l><l>Let us go and spread the news abroad to every land.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
